<title>HUNGARY: BALATON FUSZERT WIDENS H1 LOSSES.</title>
<headline>BALATON FUSZERT WIDENS H1 LOSSES.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June</p>
<p>30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-June 1997     Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating result		104.4	 vs	40.1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax result		  188.8 loss  vs     132.7 loss</p>
<p>    Net sales		     2,457.4	 vs   2,955.2</p>
<p>    Other revenue		    35.1	 vs	 3.6</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales     2,446.5	 vs   2,921.2</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales     102.3	 vs     142.3</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	     48.1	 vs	22.9</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   84.4 loss  vs	89.5 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	     0.7	 vs	 1.4</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure	85.1	 vs	90.1</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	0.04 profit vs     3.1 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Balaton Fuszert Kereskedelmi Rt is a food and</p>
<p>household chemicals retailer.</p>
<p>The figures are not audited and were calculated in</p>
<p>accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1  327-4040</p>
</text>
